      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Spin ice provides an unusually clear realization of emergent magnetic monopole-like excitations and a fractionalized Coulomb phase in a real material.",
        "attribution": "Castelnovo and Moessner developed the monopole interpretation; Bramwell's experimental work helped establish the phenomenon.",
        "maturity": "The central ideas have been tested and developed in a substantial body of experimental and theoretical work.",
        "uncertainties": [
